  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Simulates lighting using a normal map without relying on the engine
    lighting pipeline.

    Useful for debugging normals, light direction, and shading
    behavior in isolation.

    Can be toggled on/off to compare simulated lighting
    against the real shader output.'
